  "whyNotReceipted": "Arm equivalence does NOT hold. Receipting a non-equivalent run would enter it into the evidence chain of palette.seeds, which is exactly the false green the criterion exists to prevent. Same pattern as F4B/experience-profile/bithire-editorial.DIVERGENCE.json and the H3 isolation artifacts.",
