    "method": "Every candidate stop compiled through the productive DB door (compileTenantThemeConfig via loadCompilerArms + dbTenantIdentity), in the three verticals, BEFORE any stop was authored.",
    "finding": "The background role is NOT independently writable: every candidate throws TenantThemeValidationError in 3/3 verticals. A ground change without a paired foreground change leaves the default foregrounds under the governed APCA floor.",
